OL,3,GNEWSAHouses evacuated after device
OL,4,Afound in garden
OL,5,
OL,6,FA number of homes have been evacuated
OL,7,Fin a Leicestershire town after a
OL,8,Fsuspected explosive device was found.
OL,10,FPolice said they were called to Station
OL,11,FRoad, Bagworth, shortly before 12:00
OL,12,FBST on Saturday after a suspicious
OL,13,Fobject was uncovered in a garden.
OL,15,FA cordon was set up and nearby
OL,16,Fresidents asked to leave as a
OL,17,Fprecaution while the Explosive Ordnance
OL,18,FDisposal Unit (EOD) were alerted.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
