OL,3,GNEWSAHouses evacuated after device
OL,4,Afound in garden
OL,5,
OL,6,FOnce EOD officers arrived they examined
OL,7,Fthe device and removed it from the
OL,8,Fscene and householders were allowed to
OL,9,Freturn by 16:00. Police have not
OL,10,Fconfirmed what the object was nor how
OL,11,Fmany homes were evacuated.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
